        <https://www.sasbdb.org/data/SASDRF9/file/pddf> ;
    lambdaber:description "Solution NMR structure of human precursor microRNA 31 (PDB 8FCS, BMRB 31061) with SEC-SAXS data on the same RNA (SASBDB SASDRF9) fitted against the NMR ensemble." ;
